Xtwork v2 IM Bridge third-party notices
=======================================

This package (`im-bridge/`) vendors and adapts MIT-licensed channel interfaces,
channel adapters, state machines, formatting utilities, and OS credential store
integrations from upstream open-source projects, and depends on two official
MIT-licensed IM platform SDKs.

  1. earayu/Mingle (commit 006220e880d2134665ce2745ab6233f52c8eabe9) .. MIT
  2. xmanrui/dsh-im (protocol reference in WeChat / WeCom adapters) ... MIT
  3. @larksuiteoapi/node-sdk v1.76.0 ................................. MIT
  4. @wecom/aibot-node-sdk v1.0.7 ..................................... MIT

------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. earayu/Mingle
------------------------------------------------------------------------

What:     Platform-agnostic IM Channel abstraction, mention parser,
          connection/inbound/access state machines, message formatter,
          OS keychain/DPAPI/Secret Service credential helpers, and
          Feishu / WeCom / WeChat channel adapters.
Upstream: https://github.com/earayu/Mingle
Commit:   006220e880d2134665ce2745ab6233f52c8eabe9
License:  MIT

